  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Easy Elevators 透過多區塊結構，讓您使用現有資源來建造電梯。這讓玩家能夠瞬間且輕鬆地在大距離間上下移動。模組高度可自訂，預設情況下可使用<strong>鐵塊／銅塊</strong>作為基座，並使用<strong>鐵鏈／末影桿</strong>作為連接件。您也可以完全關閉對連接鏈的需求。<br><br>電梯的預設最小尺寸為 3x3，最大尺寸為 5x5。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's Extra Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>elevatorBlocks</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"minecraft:iron_block,minecraft:copper_block\"<br>視為電梯方塊的資源位置。<br><br><span><strong>elevatorChains</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"minecraft:chain,minecraft:end_rod\"<br>視為電梯連接件的方塊資源位置。<br><br><span><strong>minimumElevatorSize</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 3，最小 1，最大 33<br>電梯必須具備的最小尺寸。預設為 3，代表 3x3 的空間。<br><br><span><strong>maximumElevatorSize</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 5，最小 1，最大 33<br>電梯可以達到的最大尺寸。預設為 5，代表 5x5 的空間。<br><br><span><strong>elevatorMustBeConnectedViaChains</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>兩個鐵塊是否必須透過鏈條連接才能作為電梯運作。<br><br><span><strong>maximumChainlessElevatorHeight</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 20，最小 1，最大 1000<br>在停用「elevatorMustBeConnectedViaChains」時，電梯一次可上升或下降的最大方塊數量。更具體來說，是模組向上和向下檢查以尋找另一個電梯方塊的範圍。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>當站在電梯多區塊上時，按下跳躍鍵上升，蹲下鍵下降：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/easy-elevators/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>在預設設定下；使用以下任一組合皆可運作：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/easy-elevators/b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系中，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。感謝支持！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
